{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10018_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:549761e1162bb51a83002b48d5f36dd131df806ec9cd64fa51a0ca0fbaf72fc2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150cf7004730a0d0640fb5937c5f5182649bcb49fdaa853651bbdca5af477d08",
      "text": "录制当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:391bfac4f6b4298546cfa72536704deab6302e2a5b950c070ecc31b815046a44",
      "text": "接下来要介绍的是，来自315 Production的\n白色情人节限定特别组合！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838b89dc6a58aef136d06b036c189e4ea6b422a9ac67dd841952edda8614e30a",
      "text": "那么，让我们来听听各位的想法吧。\n组成组合之后，有什么变化吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19538b9c00e41c9fbc780b7c5ac8a46b9ca51f0554e1903c306ff7bfc295848d",
      "text": "那个，在练习过程中，\n有了大家一起吃点心的时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fdf0f730c84ff8d271db7c5a55f29905a1f82f6fc96ea2b3799b3628262955e",
      "text": "好——！托组成组合的福，\n我和涟亲成了猫亲朋友☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97009aa9b3bc4d6b8eb908da031977e17684630c19992c69ed12f73bd3a3e4c5",
      "text": "我可不记得跟你是那种关系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203c720a2c8621f42407ba8f94f4d173db1b0348893430668a7a3b29da1fede2",
      "text": "那就从现在开始！\n我们是猫亲朋友啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2792957c05f26f64fdda82a819d99142010a5974c92c0d3755a8de8fa0ecf02",
      "text": "啊哈哈，真是很棒的关系呢！\n古论先生，请向大家介绍一下新歌吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c0ce7991abdc54fe25fad693d6a0f0ccda431b67e2f5bbec11d77df7ed2e101",
      "text": "我们有幸演唱的这首歌，是情人节时\n与CM联动的歌曲的后续。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66bae1d6b99c1695c6e89ef12ea291f0caba8f08b95ba850aad9b7b87d815341",
      "text": "视角不同的歌词，\n也请大家务必多多关注。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2faab4fe0dfdede03bb7e2407fc9024e16ef3e5dd9d33ee91c493d1e9e217eb",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n那么牙崎先生，最后请谈谈看点吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_k:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a955ac52a9d9ea92f32b9c57ff823f84681545617353fb1710f104b287c4851c",
      "text": "那还用问吗。\n当然是本大爷了！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
